Z||000014||88formula||04-21-2000||08:59 PM||||Why would anyone want to put a big-ass speaker in there car that makes all the screws come loose and the cars next to yours windows rattle? Whats wrong with a simple natural sounding radio?||||reg||1
Z||000015||stillofknight||04-22-2000||04:42 PM|||| Natural sound is why you need a subwoofer. The human ear can detect sounds down to 20 hz. Do you think those wimpy 4x10's in your dasn can reproduce those notes? Most of the energy in music is centered below 500hz, so you need good midbass and subbass for truly natural sound. And 8" is not a big ass speaker. That would be a 15" or 18" sub.||||reg||1
